{"tab":"series","page":289,"pages":367,"count":21970,"pageSize":60,"items":[{"id":"4328","ru":"Примитивная страна","en":"A Country Practice","year":"1981","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":14,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hxtsmmB1NsglgitpfmUMCQ2Cjnt.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3i9g6Yex8FhXK99kxuVBFAWX9XM.jpg","genres":["Мыльная опера","драма"],"overview":"Австралийская медицинская мыльная опера.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"4850","ru":"Отдел убийств","en":"City Homicide","year":"2007","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":14,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/lSJWL9TKsOrb9Gz7CppvKJgU6Ii.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dKnEaeiThQqwobvoRx90IfKKL30.jpg","genres":["криминал","драма"],"overview":"Самая большая честь и ответственность для полицейского - это расследование убийств. Не всегда убийства совершаются маньяками или закоренелыми преступниками, убийцами могут стать обычные люди из-за страха, отчаяния, желания отомстить. Эта драма рассказывает о расследовании мотивов, которые движут убийцами: кто они, почему они идут на это и о том, как полиции удается поймать их. Расследованиями занимается четверка проницательных, амбициозных и очень обаятельных полицейских, для которых тоеступления, убийства и опасность - часть повседневной жизни.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"62521","ru":"Acacias 38","en":"Acacias 38","year":"2015","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":14,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uApImWv5VMhXKvv543EvJlAN29O.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p1vfmHHZkxCaTFDXjYNGB3WSkak.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"390","ru":"Вечерняя тень","en":"Evening Shade","year":"1990","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":14,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/46x0EFL5Sw6G5d7ak8mHgTz8bmJ.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aywbSB4Y7s6CxnalJOeOSpDudMf.jpg","genres":["комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"10458","ru":"The Real McCoys","en":"The Real McCoys","year":"1957","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2xpqTNMVtnBfXQVAR1eP5ay2UAz.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1XF2p5Tyuq5W8R6QorwXwiDlsIB.jpg","genres":["комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"33404","ru":"Тайны и секреты личной жизни студентов","en":"Co-Ed Confidential","year":"2007","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jWPDBZjd1SONIbPmTRY3N0frwRN.jpg","backdrop":"","genres":["драма","комедия"],"overview":"Первокурсники, заселившиеся в легендарный дом ОМЕГА, решили отметить новоселье шумной вечеринкой. Когда вечеринка была в самом разгаре, к ним присоединились выпускники и тогда ребята начали знакомиться по настоящему…","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"25247","ru":"Forsthaus Falkenau","en":"Forsthaus Falkenau","year":"1989","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/flYa8BzKcoFPJprxhRhKhnFYrb9.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rkZ0uoaiZ6EzAX0gb5s3EBARuAO.jpg","genres":["драма","семейный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"53438","ru":"Circus Halligalli","en":"Circus Halligalli","year":"2013","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9PLCJFW7retN7JLWcrzJZnV7oip.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tpfaQASbtioCPQLeqq4v66IplHb.jpg","genres":["Ток-шоу","комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"61306","ru":"Unité 9","en":"Unité 9","year":"2012","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rSV4gfOWPfOqLbmx0ki6s0ucd2K.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yjh0cnVoTyqWP3L3NH1mN0E3ow6.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"261617","ru":"Проклятия","en":"Las maldiciones","year":"2025","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/x1nTOgqSWOSqAttI2QhJCK2NDAN.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8QTkUVluzNNmd3YE7hNlV37rwby.jpg","genres":["детектив","драма"],"overview":"Дочь губернатора исчезает в решающий момент его карьеры. Разрываясь между амбициями и семейными тайнами, он должен выбрать между политикой и безопасностью своего ребенка.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"999","ru":"Best Week Ever","en":"Best Week Ever","year":"2004","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":10,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jSdiH87vkxM0aXTvkaOOvtIHYCg.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9GbnI3EzZLGkKYbI1dw27vLBJks.jpg","genres":["комедия","Ток-шоу"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"79893","ru":"Ika-6 na Utos","en":"Ika-6 na Utos","year":"2016","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xr31L8MA4FtELZ0YbJgUQGTEJQ.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8MHWnG8I0Qdya5ak5AIYirQSMA9.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"17640","ru":"Kate Garraway's Life Stories","en":"Kate Garraway's Life Stories","year":"2009","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hUJkFuea7tzRAsFaX3qHZ5A5EHx.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lsnicyZfStZe1EdDzRJf7mE98IN.jpg","genres":["Ток-шоу"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"6765","ru":"Пеппер Деннис","en":"Pepper Dennis","year":"2006","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pUQWnp3rDclN4oHLJ99iA1voRcw.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s4SjRv3zoAy5qrd6FnzZFiycUo8.jpg","genres":["драма","комедия"],"overview":"Пеппер Деннис — честолюбивая репортерша, которая мечтает стать ведущей вечерних новостей Чикаго с самым высоким рейтингом. Ее повседневная жизнь осложняется тем, что к ней приезжает испорченная, нуждающаяся и одинокая сестра Кэти. Но хуже всего то, что некий парень Чарли Бэбкок, с которым Пеппер проснулась однажды утром, неожиданно появился на ее работе, получил работу ее мечты и фактически стал ее боссом. Она пытается презирать его, но Чарли умен, красив и забавен. Пеппер получает необходимую поддержку от своих близких друзей, гримера Кимми и оператора Чика, который тайно влюблен в Пеппер.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"14579","ru":"Johnny Ringo","en":"Johnny Ringo","year":"1959","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hW2ao6QN6Yns7dCaIWpdW8UbmGy.jpg","backdrop":"","genres":["вестерн"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"307677","ru":"プロフェッショナル 保険調査員・天音蓮","en":"プロフェッショナル 保険調査員・天音蓮","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":7,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jmMZlm0JApy3bMWJpvX6iBEurs6.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fZ2C0xRmKnKY2TuqL8TH033KFcV.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"5500","ru":"Специальная комиссия","en":"SOKO München","year":"1978","type":"Сериал","rating":5.9,"votes":7,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hXWVu2OyKMnfrurvCRUY1TpzOjx.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kdBkbMykQBG6oeSpJQ2nttCuvmS.jpg","genres":["криминал"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"71453","ru":"Служить и защищать","en":"Servir y proteger","year":"